# Never copy installed deps or build output into the image — every stage
# installs its own, and copying host artifacts breaks native modules built
# for a different platform (sharp, in particular).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local-only
**/storage/r/*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
**/.turbo
orqis-frontend/.next
docker-compose.override.yml

# Not needed at build or runtime
**/*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE

apps-script-setup/
launch-assets/
tests/
